Name: WASI SDK
Short Name: wasi-sdk
URL: https://github.com/WebAssembly/wasi-sdk
Version: wasi-sdk-27
Date: 2025-11-19
Update Mechanism: Git submodule
License: Apache 2.0 with LLVM exceptions
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: No (build-time tool only)
Security Critical: no
License Android Compatible: yes

Description:
WASI SDK is a WASI-enabled WebAssembly C/C++ toolchain based on Clang/LLVM.
It provides a complete compiler toolchain for compiling C/C++ code to
WebAssembly with WASI (WebAssembly System Interface) support.

This dependency is used at build time to compile zlib to WebAssembly as part
of the RLBox wasm2c sandboxing integration. 

This is only used during the build process to generate sandboxed code and is
not shipped with Chromium.

